r\n- **Allow Config Tweaks on iOS/iPadOS 26.** These have been hidden on iOS 26 but I don't see why they shouldn't work, so iOS 26 users go try this and if they're broken I'll disable them again.\r\n- **Idiot checker.** Erosion will now show an alert when opening the app if it fails to detect its custom App Group ID and falls back to the default. If you get this, please do not go complain for support when tweaks don't work.\r\n- **GPLv3.** Erosion is now licensed under the GNU General Public License Version 3.\r\n\r\n*Note: You may face issues using the app with an enterprise/paid certificate, due to how App Groups are signed. It is recommended to use SideStore, Impactor, or any other sideloading method using your own Apple ID.*\r\n\r\n**If this is your first time using this project, please look at the [README](https://github.com/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/blob/main/README.md) before complaining or asking for support.**","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/439949081/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":1,"eyes":4},"mentions_count":1},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/438612680","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/438612680/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/438612680/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/tag/0.3","id":438612680,"author":{"login":"skadz108","id":46767289,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NzY3Mjg5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46767289?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadz108","html_url":"https://github.com/skadz108","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadz108/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadz108/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skadz108/gists{/gist_id}","s