** A full-fledged file browser is now built right inside of Erosion! Browse and modify app containers as well as other things. \r\n\r\n### Bug Fixes/Improvements\r\n* PosterBoard wallpapers are now much more reliable, including both getting the container path and adding wallpapers.\r\n* You shouldn't get kicked out of the app if you're on iPadOS 27.0db3 re-release, and you should get kicked out of the app if you're on 26.7-26.7.x (as these versions are not supported).\r\n* New Auto-Respring toggle, which will respring your device automatically for tweaks that require it.\r\n\r\n**REMINDER:** If a tweak doesn't work how you were expecting, **do not open an issue or ask for support regarding it!** All tweaks are reliant on your device cooperating properly, and in some cases this can even involve Apple's servers. We'll be unable to help you.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://github.com/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/stargazers\"> <img alt=\"GitHub Repo stars\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/jailbreakdotparty/erosion?style=flat-square&color=%23FFD300\"></a> \r\n  <a href=\"https://jailbreak.party/discord\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1349128546072793218?style=flat-square&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&color=5865F2\"></a> \r\n  <a href=\"https://jailbreak.party\"><img alt=\"Static Badge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/jailbreak.party-blue?style=flat-square&label=%20&color=3868DB\"></a>\r\n\r\nIf this is your first time checking out this project, please look at the [readme.](https://github.com/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion)","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/388826078/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/376099988","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jailbreakdotparty/Erosion/releases/376099988/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/j